"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\nspan[data-bnType=\"bibleReference\"] { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"FLORA:1.24\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">1.24</span> 标题：笃耨香树、黄连木（terebinth）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<h3 class=\"thlex-subheading\"><strong>树</strong> ：</h3>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：אֵלָה, אַלָּה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：’elah, ’alah)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen35:4\">GEN 35:4</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Josh24:26\">JOS 24:26</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Judg6:11\">JDG 6:11</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Judg6:19\">JDG 6:19</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Sam17:2\">1SA 17:2</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Sam17:19\">1SA 17:19</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Sam21:10\">1SA 21:10</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2Sam18:9\">2SA 18:9</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2Sam18:9\">2SA 18:9</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2Sam18:10\">2SA 18:10</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2Sam18:14\">2SA 18:14</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Kgs13:14\">1KI 13:14</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Chr10:12\">1CH 10:12</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa1:30\">ISA 1:30</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa6:13\">ISA 6:13</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezek6:13\">EZK 6:13</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Hos4:13\">HOS 4:13</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：אַיִל</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：’ayil)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa1:29\">ISA 1:29</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa57:5\">ISA 57:5</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa61:3\">ISA 61:3</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezek31:14\">EZK 31:14</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：אֵלֶם</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：’elem)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:1\">PSA 56:1</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：σχῖνος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：schinos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/PrAzar1:54\">SUS 1:54</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：τερέμινθος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：tereminthos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Wis24:16\">SIR 24:16</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<h3 class=\"thlex-subheading\"><strong>果实</strong> ：</h3>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：בָּטְנִים</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：boten)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen43:11\">GEN 43:11</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<h3 class=\"thlex-subheading\"><strong>树脂</strong> ：</h3>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：צֳרִי</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：tsori)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen37:25\">GEN 37:25</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen43:11\">GEN 43:11</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer8:22\">JER 8:22</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer46:11\">JER 46:11</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer51:8\">JER 51:8</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezek27:17\">EZK 27:17</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">讨论</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p><figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0864_terebinth.jpg\" alt=\"WEB-0864_terebinth\"></figure>希伯来文<em>’elah</em> 和<em>’alah</em> 指圣经中提到的三种黄连木中的任何一种：（1）大西洋黄连木（学名<em>Pistacia atlantica</em> ）；（2）笃耨香黄连木（<em>Pistacia palaestina</em> 、<em>Pistacia terebinthus</em> ）；（3）乳香黄连木（<em>Pistacia lentiscus</em> 、<em>Pistacia lenticus</em> ），又称乳香树。</p>\n<p>根据祖海里的意见，大西洋黄连木，又名椴树（teil tree），分布在尼革夫、下加利利和但河河谷。赫珀说，基列地曾盛产大西洋黄连木，树干和树皮可作为芳香树脂（乳香）的原料出口到埃及。这种树为旱地树，生长在常绿林地和矮灌木草原的邻接地带（注意<a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Sam17:2\">1SA 17:2</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Sam17:19\">1SA 17:19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Sam21:10\">1SA 21:10</a> 中的&quot;以拉谷&quot;）。大西洋黄连木的坚果可用来染色和鞣革，烤熟后也可以食用。这些坚果常在阿拉伯市场上售卖，比笃耨香黄连木的果实大，与圣地之外出产的真正的开心果非常不同（见下文）。</p>\n<p><figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/PTZ-0128_terebinth_branch.jpg\" alt=\"PTZ-0128_terebinth_branch\"></figure>笃耨香黄连木主要生长在树林茂密的山丘，经常与一般的橡树混生。小小的球形坚果可以整个生吃，或烤熟吃。这些坚果（<em>boten</em> ）可能就是雅各的儿子带到埃及的礼物（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen43:11\">GEN 43:11</a> ）；但是祖海里认为，这些礼物也可能是盛产于波斯（现伊朗）的、真正的开心果树（阿月浑子树；学名<em>Pistacia vera</em> ）的果实。</p>\n<p>乳香黄连木是一种生长在基列山的灌木或灌木丛，可能就是<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen37:25\">GEN 37:25</a> 所载以实玛利人贩卖的&quot;乳香&quot;（希伯来文<em>tsori</em> ）的原料，也可能在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen43:11\">GEN 43:11</a> 与开心果一起被雅各的儿子带到埃及。<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen37:25\">GEN 37:25</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer8:22\">JER 8:22</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer46:11\">JER 46:11</a> 均提到基列与乳香（学名<em>Tsori</em> ）之间的联系，说明乳香的原料是巴勒斯坦特有的一种植物，所以乳香<em>tsori</em> 可以用来交换埃及的货物。《耶利米书》指的可能是由笃耨香树脂制成的药膏。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>笃耨香树的外形很像橡树，但叶子呈羽状。大西洋黄连木可长到10米（33英尺）高。笃耨香黄连木较矮，高可达5米（17英尺）。乳香黄连木，或乳香树，是一种小灌木或小乔木，高为1—3米（3—10英尺），枝干切开会流出芳香的树脂。树脂干燥成硬块后再磨碎，溶解在橄榄油中，可用来制作药品、香水、熏香、清漆和胶水。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">特殊意义</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p><figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/PTZ-0129_terebinth_nuts.jpg\" alt=\"PTZ-0129_terebinth_nuts\"></figure>这两种比较高大的黄连木都受到古代以色列人和其他民族的崇敬。他们在黄连木树林里筑坛，有时还在那里埋葬死者。乳香黄连木的树脂因药用价值而被珍视，这就是为什么以实玛利人（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen37:25\">GEN 37:25</a> ）和雅各的众子（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen43:11\">GEN 43:11</a> ）将其作为交易的货物带到埃及。<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Wis24:16\">SIR 24:16</a> 用枝干舒展的黄连木来比喻智慧。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻译</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Hos4:13\">HOS 4:13</a> ，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"King James Version (1611)\">KJV</abbr> 将本应是&quot;笃耨香树&quot;的树木译作&quot;elms&quot;（&quot;榆树&quot;）。在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen35:4\">GEN 35:4</a> 中，示剑那里的笃耨香树（<em>’elah</em> ）似乎与<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen12:6\">GEN 12:6</a> 中的橡树（<em>’elon</em> ）相冲突。有些译本在这两处都使用&quot;橡树&quot;来统一译词。其他译本则都译作&quot;笃耨香树&quot;。还有的译本将这两处都译作&quot;大树&quot;或&quot;圣树&quot;。<em>’Elah</em> 很有可能在某个时期变成了大树的通称。</p>\n<p>笃耨香黄连木只生长在中东地区，但黄连木属（学名<em>Pistacia</em> ）树种分布很广，从南欧经亚洲，一直到菲律宾等地区都有。如果在当地找不到同属树木，建议使用一般性的短语，或者从一种主要语言进行音译，例如<em>terebinti</em> ，或根据希伯来文音译为<em>elahi</em> 。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:1\">PSA 56:1</a> ：虽然希伯来文<em>’elem</em> 在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:0\">PSA 56:0</a> 的标题中常作&quot;无声&quot;的意思，但大多数解经家更倾向于将其视为&quot;笃耨香树&quot;（<em>’elah</em> 、<em>’alah</em> ）的另一种拼写法。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
